<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Quotations (verbatim, chat order)</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:0;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 33:29</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Actually, this, I did not even see in the Lovable. Is it shared with me? The Storm Ridge page? I don&#x27;t think I did touch this one. Just the CoatRoof ROI and the contractor.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 34:09</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;In the email, like, I just got access to the tool along with the prompts. I think this was also on, like, we were supposed to work on it a bit later. In other words, I&#x27;ll look into it.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:19:00</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;So that&#x27;s really a B to C, I&#x27;m sorry, B to consumer marketing, not a B to B marketing.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:21:36</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Protect your roof and property before the first storm hits&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:22:16</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Can you add in-house financing available on the Hero page so they know that if they do need a repair, we also have in-house financing?&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 1:23:20</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Just want to double check with you on that. So does it need to be like a hook, like the text above the header?&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:23:20</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Oh, it&#x27;ll be on the bottom of the Hero page.&quot; (Fathom labels this as Shad)</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:23:33</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;we definitely need the name, phone number, email, and the property address. We do not need the roof size because they&#x27;re going to use our tool and get the roof size.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:24:21</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Don&#x27;t put work email because this is a consumer.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:24:21</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;And then you know where it says schedule my assessment? That&#x27;s perfectly fine.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 1:25:09</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Okay, I think we&#x27;re good on this one.&quot;</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
