<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FCEEE3" style="background-color:#FCEEE3;border-left:3px solid #B85C1E;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#B85C1E" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#B85C1E;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">▲</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Mostly accurate, with small errors. Nasir&#x27;s copy instructions are accurate. Fathom misheard a page name (&quot;repuzzle&quot; at 1:25:09) and spells Vextron as &quot;Vexeron&quot; nearby. The page has no stable name: Shad says &quot;Storm Ridge&quot; and Nasir&#x27;s headline says &quot;seal your roof before the first storm hits.&quot; The &quot;bottom of the Hero page&quot; line carries the wrong speaker label.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Convo pitfalls</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad hadn&#x27;t touched this page and had only just been given access, but Nasir expected him to be working on it. Nasir said &quot;we&#x27;re already a few days out,&quot; so a missing-access message should have gone out as soon as it was noticed. The page was also introduced late in the call, right after a long discussion of the other two.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">B2B or B2C</h2></td></tr>
