<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Quotations (verbatim, chat order)</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:0;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 1:06:49</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;This is for B2C.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:06:53</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;If you read what you built, this is for B2C. We are not getting contractors. We&#x27;re getting owners with bad roofs&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:06:53</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;So if you want to put notes on this one, blow up the logo, and let&#x27;s make sure coolroof is the focal point, because that&#x27;s what we&#x27;re offering to the consumers.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 1:09:01</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;So regarding the rooftop technology and the sunhours, you wanted me to base that off the SynergyBuildingTechnology page where we integrated the GoogleMap API. Okay. So regarding that, you want these to be all implemented in the CoolRoof ROI after the email submission, after the form submission, or do you want me to implement that as well on the other landing page?&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:09:36</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Shad, let&#x27;s focus on one thing here, because when we jump to something else, you&#x27;ll put notes in and we&#x27;ll be on that page.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:10:39</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;So we just want to make sure they can put their address and analyze their roof.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:13:02</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Keep it separate because they can enter the address and see the sun hours. And if they want the report, then ask an email, and then we&#x27;ll send a report.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:14:01</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;basic name, email, phone number, and address.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:14:01</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;the leads will go under Synergy Building Technology, company in high level, not Synergy Financial, because that&#x27;s for the loan leads.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 1:17:38</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Like, that&#x27;s what I was just saying. Like, I got confused by my Fathom transcript. So that&#x27;s why I wanted to check. That&#x27;s all on me. so we&#x27;re okay.&quot;</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
