<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:0;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 36:45</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Just put product training, not class. Product training.&quot; (Fathom labels this as Shad)</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 38:41</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;I will fix that one up as well.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 41:22</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;We would just put down win jobs, leads, financing tools, and project support through us, not in the dashboard.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 42:40</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;So get rid of the MarketingKit. Because we don&#x27;t give marketingKits out.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 42:40</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;This is more of a dealer service and a dealer signup.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 42:40</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;So can you change everything to better? VextronCertifiedDealer, to become a VextronCertifiedDealer.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 46:11</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;Okay, so just to be sure, instead of, like, you just want me to replace the third line, right?&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 46:18</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;No, just ask Lovable to change everything that says CertifiedInstaller to VextronCertifiedDealer, and it&#x27;ll do everything. It&#x27;ll change the whole website.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 52:17</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;And then remove the CSLB license and just put down and remove service area and then we&#x27;ll need their company address and we should be good to go.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 53:27</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;So just the name, the company, and for the now, just we&#x27;re going to omit the service area. Just wanted to double check, right?&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Shad (B, you) · 56:33</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;So what I was saying to you is, just if you want to keep it simple, just remove application and leave submit.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:02:49</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;We&#x27;re going to do the next training class. Date, location is going to be eliminated.&quot;</p></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color:#FFFFFF;border-top:1px solid #E3E6E8;padding:16px 0"><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#80888F;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">Nasir (A) · 1:18:27</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#1B1F23">&quot;It&#x27;s a B2B site. It&#x27;s business to business. We&#x27;re after the contractors. They&#x27;re not, they have a lot of roofs, but we don&#x27;t need it on this contractor program.&quot;</p></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Accuracy warning</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td bgcolor="#FCEEE3" style="background-color:#FCEEE3;border-left:3px solid #B85C1E;border-radius:0 8px 8px 0;padding:16px"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td valign="top" width="24" style="width:24px;padding:0 16px 0 0"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td width="24" height="24" align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#B85C1E" style="width:24px;height:24px;background-color:#B85C1E;border-radius:8px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;line-height:24px;color:#FFFFFF;mso-line-height-rule:exactly">▲</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;color:#1B1F23">Mostly accurate, partly jumbled. The instructions are clear. Raw text garbles names (&quot;Vextran&quot;, &quot;Vexeron&quot;, &quot;CertifiedInstaller&quot;). The 36:45 turn has Nasir&#x27;s words under Shad&#x27;s label. The &quot;seats are limited per region&quot; line at 57:49 also has the wrong label and sounds like Nasir, so it is left out of the chat above.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">Convo pitfalls</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0 0 16px 0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">The wording went around in circles: &quot;class&quot; versus &quot;training&quot;, then &quot;installer&quot; versus &quot;contractor&quot; versus &quot;dealer&quot;. Shad built the form from Nasir&#x27;s own prompt, which said &quot;training&quot;, yet the page said &quot;class&quot;, and tracing that cost several minutes on the call. Agreeing the audience and key terms once at the start would have avoided most of the back-and-forth.</p></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 0 8px 0"><h2 style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;font-weight:600;color:#1B1F23">B2B or B2C</h2></td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:0"><p style="margin:0;font-family:'Geist',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:32px;color:#1B1F23;overflow-wrap:anywhere;word-break:break-word">B2B, and relevant to the Vextron landing page sites.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>
